  "body": "Found while gating the #3234 PR: `cargo xtask catalog --check` is red on `origin/main` (untouched by that PR).\n\n## What happens\n\nThe catalog case `2d/drill-overfeed` is declared `expect = \"refusal\"` with `refusal.txt` committed and no `.nc` output. The checker still demands `drill-overfeed.nc`, so the check fails:\n\n```\n2d/drill-overfeed: missing drill-overfeed.nc\n```\n\n## Done means\n\n- `catalog --check` accepts a refusal case that commits `refusal.txt` without an `.nc` file, or the case is fixed to match the checker - whichever the catalog tooling intends.\n- `cargo xtask catalog --check` is green on `main`.\n\nObserved on `origin/main` (fd64cc2f lineage) on 2026-11-22 during the #3234 gate.\n",
